 loader memory leaks offline\\n\\n**Status**: Completed\\n\\n**Assignee**: Bob\\n\\n**Priority**: Normal\\n\\n**Date Created**: 2026-08-15\\n\\n## Activity History\\n\\n- **2026-08-15**: Alice - Task Create (Open)\\n\\n - *Opened the task because memory-leak profiling is needed after the large-file chunking work.*\\n\\n- **2026-08-23**: Bob - Tracemalloc Patch (Completed)\\n\\n - *Patched PDF loader leaks found via tracemalloc, depending on the large-file chunking path.*\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"clickup task ciph 43 sourc id src cu ciph 43 task id ciph 43 titl find and patch pdf loader memori leak offlin status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 descript profil and patch memori leak hotspot in the pdf loader follow signal from the larg file chunk rework standard profil tool wa unavail in the offlin lab so the team switch to stdlib tracemalloc the result leak were patch depend on the larg file chunk path clickup task ciph 43 sourc id src cu ciph 43 task id ciph 43 titl find and patch pdf loader memori leak offlin status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 accept criterion leak hotspot in the pdf loader are identifi use an offlin compat profil tool identifi leak are patch verifi against the larg file chunk depend clickup task ciph 43 sourc id src cu ciph 43 task id ciph 43 titl find and patch pdf loader memori leak offlin status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 descript profil and patch memori leak hotspot in the pdf loader follow signal from the larg file chunk rework standard profil tool wa unavail in the offlin lab so the team switch to stdlib tracemalloc the result leak were patch depend on the larg file chunk path clickup task ciph 43 sourc id src cu ciph 43 task id ciph 43 titl find and patch pdf loader memori leak offlin status complet assigne bob prioriti normal date creat 2026 08 15 activ histori 2026 08 15 alic task creat open open the task becaus memori leak profil is need after the larg